<ul>
<li>Two questions, and they have to be answered in order.</li>
<li>One: do preferences estimated on a static table survive being shown real congestion?</li>
<li>Two: can the model write a whole city's day, not a sample?</li>
<li>Neither is interesting alone. Together they decide whether any policy answer means anything.</li>
</ul>
